thor":"goldenwalrus909","body":"This is a wonderful map, but I'm not quite liking the idea of having the monuments in the middle; they'll be very difficult to get and cause the map to be a bit too much of a stalemate. I would also recommend you to give the pickaxe an efficiency 2 upgrade if not an efficiency 3 to give the rushers more of a chance. You may even considering building out wings to move the monuments onto, so the map isn't as linear. However, this does look like a great, fun map, and I would really like to see some more out of it. Very nicely done, man ;D","body_tagged":"This is a wonderful map, but I'm not quite liking the idea of having the monuments in the middle; they'll be very difficult to get and cause the map to be a bit too much of a stalemate. I would also recommend you to give the pickaxe an efficiency 2 upgrade if not an efficiency 3 to give the rushers more of a chance. You may even considering building out wings to move the monuments onto, so the map isn't as linear. However, this does look like a great, fun map, and I would really like to see some more out of it. Very nicely done, man ;D","created_at":1435984103},{"id":208167,"author":"steven5703","body":"\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003eYour map has been denied, sorry!\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003cb style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003eYour map's\u0026nbsp;\u003c/b\u003e\u003cb style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003ecomments\u0026nbsp;can be viewed at the Avicus map trello\u003c/b\u003e\u003cb style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helve